  chapterName: Tiyanak
  chapterDescription: A monster that disguises itself as a crying baby to trick travelers.
    Once picked up, it reveals fangs and sharp claws to attack.
  chapterUnlocked: 0
  storyUnlocked: 0
  killsNeededToUnlockName: 1
  killsNeededToUnlockImage: 1
  killsNeededToUnlockDesc: 1
  shortStory: "Desperate cries echoed through the dark banana grove as Elena walked
    home.\r\n\r\nFollowing the sound, she found a swaddled bundle at the base of
    a tree. Heart aching, she scooped the baby into her arms. But when she lifted
    the blanket, the crying stopped instantly.\r\n\r\nLooking up at her was a creature
    with wrinkled, fanged jaws, glowing red eyes, and razor-sharp claws reaching
    for her neck.\r\n\r\nElena gasped, dropped the monster, and threw a handful of
    salt from her pocket directly at its face. It hissed in agony, shrinking back
    into the shadows.\r\n\r\nShe bolted, not stopping until she was locked safely
    inside\u2014with the baby's eerie, artificial cries still echoing far behind
    her.\r"
